{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1789049274","published":"2026-09-10T14:08:08Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:03.770075259Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-23631"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-23631","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: Lua VM re-entry when a resync payload is processed while a\n     timed-out script is still on the stack\n     - debian/patches/0027-CVE-2026-23631.patch: return early from\n       readSyncBulkPayload() in src/replication.c while server.lua_timedout is\n       set, so rdbLoadRio() cannot reach luaCreateFunction() on the lua_State\n       that is paused inside the running script. Backport of upstream redis\n       commit 80c2b5a0a, substituting server.lua_timedout for the 7.0\n       isInsideYieldingLongCommand() helper. Applied as defence in depth: the\n       use-after-free CVE-2026-23631 describes is not reachable on 6.0.16, where\n       scriptingReset() is reached only via SCRIPT FLUSH and not from the resync\n       path.\n     - CVE-2026-23631","affected":[{"package":{"name":"redis","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/redis?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5:6.0.16-1+deb11u9+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789049274.json"}},{"package":{"name":"redis-sentinel","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/redis-sentinel?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5:6.0.16-1+deb11u9+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789049274.json"}},{"package":{"name":"redis-server","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/redis-server?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5:6.0.16-1+deb11u9+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.c